# Text entry in an edit box, loaded from the game's autosave: found a base with the colony pod (b), open its
# base screen (Return) and its Rename window, whose Name box starts with the old name selected. Typing
# replaces the selection, Backspace and Delete remove characters, Left, Right and Home move the caret, and Cancel
# leaves the name as it was; the base is not renamed. (The keys that make no character reach the box as clicks
# too, as the number their key code has: the box shows $, % and . among the text. That is how the game, with
# the window layer's MapVirtualKey, treats them, in the original's code as in Chiron's.) Leave time after each
# step; a snap takes two seconds.
# The leaders' portraits in the base screen animate on their own slow clock.
mask 266 625 310 678
mask 702 624 760 680
25 load
48 click 362 734         # the note's Close
55 key b                 # found a base where the colony pod stands
64 key Return            # its base screen
72 click 398 523         # RENAME
80 snap rename
84 type Fox              # replaces the selected name
88 snap typed
92 key BackSpace
95 snap backspace
99 key Left
102 snap left
106 key Delete
109 snap delete
113 key Home
116 snap home
120 type ab
123 snap typed-again
127 key Right
130 snap right
134 click 677 429         # CANCEL
138 snap cancelled
142 close
